1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,786
Two fighters. Same skill. One in red, one in blue.

2
00:00:03,086 --> 00:00:05,083
At the Olympics, the one in red wins more often.

3
00:00:05,583 --> 00:00:08,045
So researchers took the same fights and just swapped the colors.

4
00:00:08,345 --> 00:00:10,434
The red fighter still scored thirteen percent higher.

5
00:00:10,934 --> 00:00:13,210
Same kick. Same human. Just a different color.

6
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,568
It was never the fighter. It was the referee.

7
00:00:16,188 --> 00:00:17,627
Full story on Second Glance.

